              "fill": "#5A4A10",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Three banners arrive like real Herald banners: slide in from the right edge 24 px + fade, 140 ms stagger, ease-out-expo 520 ms; the front one lands last. Then the 3×4 grid overlay draws itself over the front banner (lines grow from the top-left, 600 ms) and the “3 × 4 slot grid” tag pops. Reduced-motion: final frame.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$sans",
              "fontSize": 12
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "GXiCi",
